'''Hammertown''' was an area home to a large [[Ithorian]] population<ref name="Takobo" /> in [[Takobo City]]<ref name="Concept" /> on the world [[Takobo]].<ref name="Takobo" /> During the [[Early rebellion against the Galactic Empire|early rebellion]] against the [[Galactic Empire]], two Imperial [[Inquisitorius|Inquisitors]]&mdash;the [[Seventh Sister]] and the [[Fifth Brother]]&mdash;captured a [[Force-sensitive]] [[Pypey|Ithorian]] there. The [[Youngling|infant]] was [[Duel in Hammertown|rescued]] by [[Ezra Bridger]] and other members of the [[Spectres|rebel crew]] of the ''[[Ghost]]''.<ref name="The Future of the Force">{{Rebels|The Future of the Force}}</ref>

